{"id":"2b7f27c890af1dc3","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-interpretation.md","title":"Interpretation","display":"df-interpretation — Interpretation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-interpretation","aliases":["92-df-interpretation"],"display":"df-interpretation — Interpretation","depends_on":["[[92-df-signature]]"],"source":"本地算术结构的 Tarski 语义；对照原书第 II 章 pp.18–19 的指定解释；任意结构版本是本地展开","source_status":"原书解释概念的本地语义扩展"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-interpretation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-interpretation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-interpretation — Interpretation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地算术结构的 Tarski 语义；对照原书第 II 章 pp.18–19 的指定解释；任意结构版本是本地展开"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书解释概念的本地语义扩展"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\neq\\emptyset\">\\(A\\neq\\emptyset\\)</span> (nonempty domain)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_G\">\\(\\Sigma_G\\)</span> (arithmetic signature, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Interp}_G(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Interp}_G(A)\\)</span> (definition-target interpretation set)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}interpretation} \\vdash \\mathrm{Interp}_G(A)\\coloneqq\\{(a_0,s,p,m,e)\\mid a_0\\in A\\land s:A\\to A\\land p:A^2\\to A\\land m:A^2\\to A\\land e=\\{(a,a)\\mid a\\in A\\}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}interpretation} \\vdash \\mathrm{Interp}_G(A)\\coloneqq\\{(a_0,s,p,m,e)\\mid a_0\\in A\\land s:A\\to A\\land p:A^2\\to A\\land m:A^2\\to A\\land e=\\{(a,a)\\mid a\\in A\\}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>解释：为语言符号指派意义</li>\n<li>常量解释：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0^{\\mathfrak{M}} \\in |\\mathfrak{M}|\">\\(0^{\\mathfrak{M}} \\in |\\mathfrak{M}|\\)</span></li>\n<li>函数解释：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+^{\\mathfrak{M}}: |\\mathfrak{M}|^2 \\to |\\mathfrak{M}|\">\\(+^{\\mathfrak{M}}: |\\mathfrak{M}|^2 \\to |\\mathfrak{M}|\\)</span></li>\n<li>谓词解释：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"=^{\\mathfrak{M}} \\subseteq |\\mathfrak{M}|^2\">\\(=^{\\mathfrak{M}} \\subseteq |\\mathfrak{M}|^2\\)</span></li>\n<li>标准解释：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathbb{N}\\)</span>中的标准意义</li>\n<li>非标准解释：其他模型中的意义</li>\n<li>解释连接语法与语义</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma_G$ (arithmetic signature, see [[92-df-signature]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\neq\\emptyset","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Interp}_G(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}interpretation} \\vdash 